{"shortDescription":"The euro was little changed just above $1.16 as investors digested the far-right AfD’s victory in Saxony-Anhalt and looked ahead to the European Central Bank’s policy meeting later this week, with higher oil prices adding to inflation concerns.The AfD won 44% of the vote, falling short of an overal…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The euro was little changed just above $1.16 as investors digested the far-right AfD’s victory in Saxony-Anhalt and looked ahead to the European Central Bank’s policy meeting later this week, with higher oil prices adding to inflation concerns."]},{"type":"p","children":["The AfD won 44% of the vote, falling short of an overall majority but delivering a major blow to Chancellor Friedrich Merz’s conservatives."]},{"type":"p","children":["Meanwhile, Brent crude moved closer to seven-week highs after the US struck three Iranian oil tankers over the weekend, destroying one, while Tehran threatened to establish a new restricted zone outside the Strait of Hormuz."]},{"type":"p","children":["The ECB is expected to raise interest rates on Thursday, erring on the side of caution as the US-Iran war drags on, keeping oil prices elevated and reviving inflationary pressures."]},{"type":"p","children":["Traders are also pricing in roughly a 90% probability of a second rate hike by the end of the year."]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Forex","args":[{"id":"category","value":"forex"}]},{"title":"Trading Economics","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"trading-economics"}]}],"id":"te_news:581575:0","title":"Euro Steady as AfD Victory and ECB Hike in Focus","published":1788766426,"urgency":2,"link":"https://tradingeconomics.com/euro-area/currency","permission":"preview","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"FX:EURUSD","currency-logoid":"country/US","base-currency-logoid":"country/EU","logo":{"style":"pair","logoid":"country/EU","logoid2":"country/US"}},{"symbol":"FTMO_OANDA:EURUSD.SIM","currency-logoid":"c